            "review_title": "Review at Quan Oc Ba Tron",
            "review_text": "travellin_nick\nVienna, Austria65 contributions\n0\nMouth watering seafood for locals in D3\nDec 2017 • Couples\nJust in the middle of an area full of cafes this little walkway restaurant in a small park offers super fresh and unbelievable great tasting seafood, served within minutes. A great eat out for locals and visitors alike, this local place bursts with tastes, aromas and atmosphere alike. Went there twice, everytime a perfect experience. This is vietnamese seafood cooking at its absolute top. If you happen to be close D3 don´t miss out on that one. Simply perfect!!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 18, 2018",
